{"cluster_id":"FCL-VERIFICATION-MODEL-001","decided_at":"2026-09-07T01:10:16Z","decision_id":"EFD-20260907T011016Z-88D7BF2F","decision_note":"Pre-release deterministic catches should not be conflated with escaped defects in Framework health metrics. Evidence is strong inside one project; cross-project confirmation is still pending.","decision_revision":"066270a770adbe8bc2c73622fe7b1bce6f03af08","evidence":["project:.erei/learning/RETROSPECTIVE_SUMMARY.md","github-pr:48","github-pr:49","github-pr:54"],"promotion_state":"not_promoted","review_state":"clustered","schema_version":1,"source":{"feedback_id":"EFF-20260907T010601Z-88D7BF2F","repository":"lijust/EREI-App-Google","revision":"a862f1e24fe25cc43d208b8ef26861977a767617"}}
{"cluster_id":"FCL-VERIFICATION-MODEL-001","decided_at":"2026-09-07T01:10:16Z","decision_id":"EFD-20260907T011016Z-51FBCEB9","decision_note":"Deterministic acceptance rules can themselves be invalidated by runtime evidence. Product failure and acceptance-model failure need separate semantics before this becomes a Framework candidate.","decision_revision":"066270a770adbe8bc2c73622fe7b1bce6f03af08","evidence":["project:.erei/learning/RETROSPECTIVE_SUMMARY.md","github-pr:7","github-pr:9"],"promotion_state":"not_promoted","review_state":"clustered","schema_version":1,"source":{"feedback_id":"EFF-20260907T010601Z-51FBCEB9","repository":"lijust/EREI-App-Google","revision":"a862f1e24fe25cc43d208b8ef26861977a767617"}}
{"cluster_id":"FCL-CONFORMANCE-LADDER-001","decided_at":"2026-09-07T01:10:16Z","decision_id":"EFD-20260907T011016Z-41B9942F","decision_note":"Static/generic-engine, managed-provider, exact target-runtime and convergence evidence are distinct assurance dimensions. One project provides several independent examples; promotion remains gated by candidate spec/evals and preferably additional project evidence.","decision_revision":"066270a770adbe8bc2c73622fe7b1bce6f03af08","evidence":["project:.erei/learning/RETROSPECTIVE_SUMMARY.md","github-pr:41","github-pr:67","github-pr:70","github-pr:8"],"promotion_state":"not_promoted","review_state":"clustered","schema_version":1,"source":{"feedback_id":"EFF-20260907T010601Z-41B9942F","repository":"lijust/EREI-App-Google","revision":"a862f1e24fe25cc43d208b8ef26861977a767617"}}
